warning[use_after_free]: `q` is used after the call above freed it
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/resources/bad.jai:17:18
   |
14 |     p := New(int);
   |          -------- storage derived here
   ...
16 |     release_inferred(p);
   |     ------------------- storage invalidated here
17 |     print("%\n", q.*);
   |                  ^
   |
   = help: free it after its last use, or give it a new value before using it again
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/use_after_free

warning[use_after_free]: `p` is used after the call above freed it; every path passes one of these 2 invalidating calls
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/resources/bad.jai:24:18
   |
21 |     p := New(int);
   |          -------- storage derived here
22 |     if flag free(p);
   |             ------- storage invalidated here
23 |     else free(p);
   |          ------- storage invalidated here
24 |     print("%\n", p.*);
   |                  ^
   |
   = help: free it after its last use, or give it a new value before using it again
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/use_after_free

warning[use_after_free]: this returns storage released by deferred cleanup
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/resources/bad.jai:30:12
   |
28 |     p := New(int);
   |          -------- storage derived here
29 |     defer free(p);
   |           ------- storage invalidated here
30 |     return p;
   |            ^
   |
   = help: transfer ownership to the caller, or return a copy made outside the released storage
   = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/use_after_free

