warning[double_free]: `handle` is freed a second time
  --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/resources/bad.jai:60:5
   |
59 |     close_handle(handle);
   |     -------------------- storage derived here
   |     -------------------- storage invalidated here
60 |     close_handle(handle);
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
   |
   = help: remove the second call, or assign `handle` a new value in between
