warning[double_free]: this call frees storage that was already released
   --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/resources/bad.jai:164:5
    |
162 |     holder.value = New(int);
    |                    -------- storage derived here
163 |     release_field(*holder);
    |     ---------------------- storage invalidated here
164 |     release_field(*holder);
    |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |
    = help: remove the second call, or initialize the released field with a new allocation first
    = note: see https://jacket.matteopolak.com/lint-rules/double_free

