warning[temp_storage_escape]: `return_temporary` holds temporary storage, which is reset, but it is kept in a global
   --> tests/lint/pointer_lifetime/resources/bad.jai:175:25
    |
175 |     escaped_temporary = return_temporary();
    |                         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
    |                         ------------------ temporary storage allocated here
